Mode: ONE_CORRECT
Exactly one answer must have "right": true.

Example:
{
  "questions": [
    {
      "question": "She ___ to school every day.",
      "answers": [
        {"answer": "go", "right": false},
        {"answer": "goes", "right": true},
        {"answer": "going", "right": false}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
